<title>NEW ZEALAND: Countrywide cuts NZ floating mortgage to 10.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Countrywide cuts NZ floating mortgage to 10.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Countrywide Bank said on Tuesday it was cutting its floating mortgage rate to 10.75 percent from 11.5 percent, effective immediately for new customers and from December 5 for existing borrowers.</p>
<p>The recent reduction in the cost of wholesale funds had enabled the move, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
